Design: We can improve fairness by replacing uniform random sampling in the training DataLoader with a WeightedRandomSampler that oversamples underrepresented skin tones according to their inverse‐frequency weights. This ensures each batch contains a balanced representation of skin tones and may also boost overall AUROC. The rest of the pipeline—including mixup, OneCycleLR, partial freezing, and TTA—in remains unchanged so we can isolate the effect. We apply this sampler in both cross‐validation and final full‐data training.
